# The cases the native backend (stage 2) builds and runs: `sisu-conformance
# --native conformance/native.list` builds each with `sisu build --native`,
# runs the executable, and compares its standard output, standard error and
# exit status with the expectations the interpreter meets
# (conformance/README.md, "The native mode"). One case per line; the list
# grows as the backend does (`--native-survey` names the cases outside it
# that would pass).
